{"id":"715765481","kind":"article","title":"面向数学的《时空幻境》","author":"Issa Rice","original_authors":["Issa Rice"],"original_source_urls":["https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Braid_for_math"],"publisher":"Jarrett Ye","column":"Issawiki & Learning","date":"2024-08-22","updated":"2024-08-22","votes":16,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":475,"keywords":["数学教育","游戏化学习","数学探索","工作记忆","Braid"],"summary":"作者以游戏《时空幻境》（Braid）为例，指出其探索过程直观且令人欣赏，并思考如何把这种体验带入数学教学。文中指出数学探索要占用工作记忆，且概念有多种心理表征，这些特性给数学探索媒介设计带来挑战；作者建议从有指导意义的具体例子入手。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/715765481","restoration":null,"toc":[{"id":"sec-1","level":3,"title":"另见"},{"id":"sec-2","level":3,"title":"链接到本文"}],"html":"<p data-pid=\"o81pPLCp\">Braid 最神奇的地方在于玩家能立刻从直觉上理解游戏，并有一种欣赏之感。不用阅读教程手册或者查看统计数据。玩就可以了——探索就可以了。  </p><p data-pid=\"U03BDx9S\">我怎么让教数学也能带上这种 Braid 特质？一个挑战是<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Tinkering_in_math_requires_loading_the_situation_into_working_memory\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">数学探索需要将问题情境加载到工作记忆</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup></p><p data-pid=\"Ebwfa6Qy\">另一个挑战是<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Different_mental_representations_of_mathematical_objects_is_a_blocker_for_an_exploratory_medium_of_math\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">数学概念有不同的心理表征，这对于制作数学探索媒介是个挑战</a> <sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup></p><p data-pid=\"GS-Ta510\">这些问题不适用于<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Broad_augmentation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">广域认知增强</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>。但是当然了，如果我们将自己限制在广域认知增强上，我们会错过 Braid 中一些魔法般的特点。 </p><p data-pid=\"2iZykxcD\">考察有指导意义的具体例子，这可能是让数学带有 Braid 特质的一个办法。</p><h3 id=\"sec-1\">另见</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"bMY9hWix\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Duolingo_for_math\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">面向数学的多邻国</a><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"AlcDjM_d\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Thinking_Mathematics\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">数学头脑</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup><br/> </li></ul><h3 id=\"sec-2\">链接到本文</h3><ul><li data-pid=\"-bFzNh59\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Video_games_comparison_to_math\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">电子游戏 vs 数学</a><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"-MTPS-0e\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Duolingo_for_math\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">面向数学的多邻国</a><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"IzrQVZ57\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Tinkering_in_math_requires_loading_the_situation_into_working_memory\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">数学探索需要将问题情境加载到工作记忆</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"1Zn0HVHE\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Video_games_allow_immediate_exploration\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">电子游戏允许即时的探索</a>‎ <sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"KGWVUuzz\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Different_mental_representations_of_mathematical_objects_is_a_blocker_for_an_exploratory_medium_of_math\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">数学概念有不同的心理表征，这对于制作数学探索媒介是个挑战</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup><br/> </li><li data-pid=\"MUVBsUnj\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Thinking_Mathematics\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">数学头脑</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup> ‎ (<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/index.php?title=Special:WhatLinksHere&amp;target=Thinking+Mathematics\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">← links</a>)<br/> </li></ul><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><blockquote data-pid=\"p6PenHRX\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"http://paratranz.cn/projects/3131\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Thoughts Memo</a> 汉化组译制<br/>感谢主要译者 Shom，校对 Jarrett Ye<br/>原文：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://wiki.issarice.com/wiki/Braid_for_math\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Braid for math</a></blockquote><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 数学探索需要将问题加载到工作记忆 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"713659217\" href=\"#/post/713659217\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 数学概念有不同的心理表征，这对于制作数学探索媒介是个挑战 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"654018458\" href=\"#/post/654018458\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 对比狭域认知增强与广域认知增强 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"597533071\" href=\"#/post/597533071\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 数学头脑 <a href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/606450553\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/606450553</a></li><li id=\"ref-5\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-5\">↩</a> 电子游戏允许即时的探索 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"710894633\" href=\"#/post/710894633\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"715147276","title":"时空幻境（Braid）","author":"Issa Rice","votes":25,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · Issawiki & Learning"},{"id":"715949688","title":"序列 vs 常青笔记","author":"Issa Rice","votes":6,"minutes":1,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · Issawiki & Learning"},{"id":"716414197","title":"对比数学与电子游戏","author":"Issa Rice","votes":16,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"597533071","title":"对比狭域认知增强与广域认知增强","author":"Issa Rice","votes":6,"minutes":2,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"654018762","title":"数学头脑","author":"Issa Rice","votes":6,"minutes":1,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"1944442771533432041","title":"纠错练习","author":"Vipul","votes":8,"minutes":3,"reason":"跨学派视角 · Vipul"}],"rec_answers":[]}